  "body": "Currently the web-bluetooth specification does not support submitting a pin code to the device.  Pin codes are quite important in retail locations to stop the public connecting to bluetooth devices.  Additionally some manufacturers do not provide the ability to disable pin-codes.\r\n\r\nI think this is called Bluetooth v4.0's Secure Simple Pairing (SSP)",
